        "evidence": "In the original 1024x1536 image and unresampled cuff crop, the turned cuff has mottled cloth texture and a folded boundary, but individual fine yarn interlacing beside an identifiable stitched edge of that same cuff is not resolved. Hat braiding and jacket grain cannot substitute. Partial/unknown microstructure is fail.",
